speechtext:
In conformity with the reprinted bill I move that the bill be amended by substituting, for the present clause 4, clause 3 in the present bill, reading:
4.	Subsection four of section one hundred and fifteen of the said act is repealed and the following substituted therefor:-
"(4) In the other grades certificates may be granted for the following classes:-
(a)	Steamship;
(b)	Cargo steamship;
(c)	Tug;
(d)	Sailing ship;
(e)	Fore-and-aft rigged sailing ship;
(f)	Steamship licensed as a ferry."
Section as amended agreed to.
On section 5-Requirements for certificates of service as masters of certain non-passengers steamships.
